", "anxiety", "social"], "long_description": "Welcome to Innerworld: a virtual world where you can learn evidence-based mental health tools and receive support in a place where you can feel safe being yourself. Start your mental health journey today.\n \nCERTIFIED GUIDES\n \nWork through life\u2019s biggest challenges with guides certified in Cognitive Behavioral Immersion: a transformative approach to mental health support. \n \nSAFE, WELCOMING AND ANONYMOUS COMMUNITY\n \nJoin a tight-knit community exploring the thoughts, emotions and behaviors that shape us through courses, events and support groups.\n \nLIFE-CHANGING MENTAL HEALTH TOOLS\n \nEnter a virtual world that equips you with life-changing tools, so you can go back to the physical world more empowered than you left it. \n \nMEANING AND PURPOSE\n\nDiscover a sense of purpose by learning how to help others navigate life\u2019s biggest challenges.\n \nLet\u2019s find our way together.\n\nInnerworld is currently for people who are able to speak English.\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Innerworld: a virtual world where you can learn evidence-based mental health tools and receive support in a place where you can feel safe being yourself. Start your mental health journey today.\n \nWork through life\u2019s biggest challenges with guides certified in Cognitive Behavioral Immersion: a transformative approach to mental health support. \n\nLet\u2019s find our way together.\n\nInnerworld is currently for people who are able to speak English."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://inner.world/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Innerworld", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://inner.world/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_s